WEBVTT

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:40.510
Oh, my.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:27.550
Rose Maiden

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.220
What? Today's no good too, Nori?

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:44.030
Sorry, Jun-kun's not doing well, so...

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:47.430
I see. You've got it rough, Nori.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:48.970
Ask me next time.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.200
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.700
Careful on your way home!

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:54.450
You always...

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:41.220
Nothing here either.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.580
Jun-kun, I'm home!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.660
Hi, package.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:55.980
Stamp, please.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:56.980
Stamp, please.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.630
Stamp, please.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:58.620
Stamp, please.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.630
Stamp, please.

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.140
Sakurada

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.430
Jun-kun!

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.860
Sakurada-san, package for you!

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.520
"Once you've perused the clause below

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:24.530
please place it in the
 second drawer of your desk.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.530
CURSE

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:31.120
The artificial spirit Holie will come for it
from an alternate dimension."

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:29.500
GRUDGE

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:36.280
Man, a fairy and an 
alternate dimension...

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.230
This feels like a rare find."

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:40.370
Let's see...

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.380
Will you wind?
Or not wind?

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:53.940
J-Jun-kun...

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.770
Knock before coming in.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.460
Jun-kun, lots of packages today.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.960
CURSE

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.960
Voodoo doll, gold and silver
pearls of happiness...

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.960
Gold and Silver
Pearls

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.200
These x-ray glasses...

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:08.300
I bought them all via mail order.
Don't just open them.

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:12.810
Please, stop it already.
If you want something, I'll...

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:13.910
No way.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:18.310
I don't want some outsider
criticizing the one thing I enjoy.

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:21.550
I'm not an outsider.
 I'm your sister.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:23.550
Shut up, Sentaku-Nori.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:24.980
B-But...

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:30.460
Iffy mail-order places like this
sometimes cheat you. On TV...

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:31.560
I know.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:37.200
Once they come and I get a good laugh,
I return them before the trial ends.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:42.330
The thrill of possibly getting stuck
with some piece of junk...

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.200
Irresistible.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.700
J-Jun-kun...

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.150
You...

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.950
...just thought it was sad.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.710
That it was creepy.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:57.520
N-Not true. I just thought
it's kind of wrong to do that.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.950
Anyway, let's find you a
cheerier hobby, like lacrosse.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:07.980
Right! Doing good!

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.960
You might have a knack!

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:13.110
Jun-kun...

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:18.850
Ship the packages in the living room
today or there's no refund.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.690
Say, Jun-kun...

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:36.320
Won't you at least eat 
meals with me again?

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:41.360
I want to have fun talks and
hear about your current hobbies.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.460
Then I'm sure you'll 
go back to school...

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:47.860
Get going already!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.030
Or you won't make it in time!

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:02.980
She completely ruined the mood.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.770
Ouch, my shin...

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:11.520
What's on the floor here?

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:43.980
T-This...

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.590
...is a doll, right?

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.370
Wow...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.220
It's huge.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.860
It's really well made.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:58.630
It's soft.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.870
She's wearing some... Figures.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.250
Just a bit is okay, right?

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.480
Oh, the neighbor's baby.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:08.480
There, there.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:10.970
Good. What's wrong?

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.280
Better hurry.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.100
You touched me.

00:10:15.270 --> 00:10:19.100
Honestly, human males
are more vulgar than I guessed.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.380
Um...

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.480
What's your name?

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:24.610
J-Jun...

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.530
Jun Sakurada.

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:27.750
Forget that.

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.250
What are you?

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:30.880
A doll, right?

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:35.260
I am Shinku, the fifth 
Rozen Maiden doll.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:37.390
Rozen Maiden?

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:40.950
But what a filthy place.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.270
It is not
worthy of me to live in.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.560
Live?

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.740
I'm reluctant but have no choice.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:49.280
After all, you wound me up.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:52.710
You must have answered Holie's query.

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.240
Holie?

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.480
Will you wind?

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:56.480
Wound? You don't mean...

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.760
It's not here. That can't be...

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:04.100
I see. It's a new superstition scam.

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:06.170
Talk about elaborate.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.490
I bet you're remote-controlled.

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:09.670
Don't touch me.

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:14.080
Honestly, this terrible
lack of etiquette is appalling.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:19.470
Could this be a curse for not taking
voodoo goods seriously?

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.380
Oh? I'd like to take 
a look at that doll.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:26.010
Look?

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.010
Pick me up.

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.660
Like this?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.420
You're holding me wrong.

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.100
Yes, like this from now on.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:37.750
What do you mean by "from now on"?

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:40.910
I can't reach. Get it.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.120
Okay, okay.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:47.400
You have quite a nice doll for a human.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.360
It's a voodoo doll though.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.590
She hardly seems like a doll...

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:57.370
She's soft, talks normally,
and even her face is human...

00:11:57.840 --> 00:11:59.610
She's a girl from any angle.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.240
What?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.100
N-Nothing.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.200
Here already, I see.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:11.360
Honestly, no time even for tea.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.280
Well, human...

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.220
...unfortunately, you're 
going to die now.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.960
If you'd rather not, swear.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.190
T-This is dumb.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:58.470
I don't really care if I die.

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:00.520
It may be a threat, but...

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:09.710
I-I'm going to die! I'm going to die!

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:09.710
Please, it only cut your clothing.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:15.780
Damn it.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.420
Help me!

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.430
Someone!

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.830
This one has come to kill you.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.980
Human, I will ask you just once more.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:34.770
Will you swear?

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:36.500
Will you not?

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.320
I'll swear!

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.510
I'll swear, so hurry!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:46.040
Then prove it upon this rose.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.340
Good boy, Jun.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.570
W-What the...

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:22.240
I-It's hot...

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.830
Endure it.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:27.030
You have become my medium.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:28.560
Medium?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:32.490
I'm sorry, you two, 
but wake up for a bit.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:53.640
No mischief.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:09.150
Poor thing.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.730
Am I saved?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.650
Thanks to your dolls.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:13.830
Mine?

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.250
Dolls choose masters.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:19.730
They worked this hard
because they want to protect you.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:24.840
You're not a bad human.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.610
What's going on here?

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.360
W-What the...?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.510
I suddenly feel dizzy.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:39.250
Tired after only using this much power?
What a pitiful servant.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.190
W-What's that?

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.920
You swore to protect me, Shinku.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.130
You've become my servant.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.250
The rose ring is proof of that.

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:51.960
T-This?

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.730
While you wear that...

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:57.700
...you're a medium who keeps
supplying my power through it.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:00.680
In other words, an intermediary.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.040
Like earlier.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.360
Using my strength?

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.400
I-I won't let you!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.550
I'll just...

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.200
Force it off and flesh will go too.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.690
Ow...

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:17.320
Jun...

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:22.330
...this one is worried that there seems
to be a hole in your heart.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.760
A hole?

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:26.760
Are you sure he's not 
talking about himself?

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:30.220
Hey, where are you going?

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:36.740
Jun.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:37.740
What?

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.980
Go make tea.

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.660
Tea... Tea...

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.260
Why do I have to do this?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.790
I'm home!

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.140
Oh?

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:15.600
Jun-kun? What's wrong?

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.780
Nothing.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.420
What?

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:25.640
I thought I wrote "Jun," but it's "Jum"!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.710
Prepare those things all you want.
 It's pointless.

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:30.260
Jun-kun...

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:33.100
But you did become a 2nd year...

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:38.270
They say middle school's 2nd year
is fun with underclassmen.

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.640
Just leave me alone.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.010
Like they do.

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:44.200
T-That's not true.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.440
Mom and Dad are just overseas
because of work...

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:52.280
Anyway, I won't do anyone's bidding!
And I won't go to school!

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:53.180
Ever.

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.330
Jun-kun...

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.160
Don't look!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.060
Don't move.

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:08.360
No matter what.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:13.600
Jun-kun!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.520
Make tea.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:18.340
Now. Got it?

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:25.350
"Leave me alone," and 
now it's "make tea"...

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:36.130
What were you doing there?

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:38.430
I got tired of waiting.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.450
You know...

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:43.580
Before that, your earlier behavior
was rude to the lady.

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.040
That's not a doll's business.

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:49.970
A servant unaware of proper speech.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.930
You still don't grasp your position?

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.380
You don't know when to stop.

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:57.770
All right, fine.

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:00.920
I'll show you a human's terror.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.660
My eyes! My eyes!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:08.620
Jun-kun, I brought the tea.

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:13.630
Here, it's orange pekoe.
If you don't mind, I'll join...

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.930
Here, happy now?

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.740
Aren't you going to drink it?

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.440
Your own cup?

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:28.440
You're not having any?

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:31.500
Her tea is bad.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:33.350
I see.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.310
Yes...

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.350
It's too tepid.

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:45.360
The leaves aren't fully open,
and the fragrance is gone.

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:48.210
This can hardly be called tea.

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:49.990
But...

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.800
...it has a very gentle flavor.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:55.740
Very.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:59.470
Jun, you are loved.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.760
If you don't look, you wouldn't know...

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.940
How delicious this tea is...

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.450
Nor how caring they are...

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:26.140
Say, Jun-kun...

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.210
What?

00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:31.370
Well...

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.770
was it good?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.300
Uh, um...

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.280
Don't bother me.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.560
It's a little...

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:46.620
...better.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.590
Good boy, Jun.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:56.460
That is promising enough to cultivate.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:00.060
After all, I've chosen you as a servant.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:03.190
I said I won't be your serva...

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.250
Jun-kun!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.780
Jun-kun, that girl...

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:17.700
Now that I look at her, it's a doll...

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:20.420
What is your name?

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.850
Eek! She spoke!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:25.760
Nori. Nori Sakurada.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.020
But what a well-crafted doll!

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:31.690
Is this a Western Dutch...

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:33.010
No!

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.670
It's okay.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:37.930
I read that adolescent 
boys are like that.

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:40.960
I said it's not! Get out!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:41.800
Wait, don't be shy...

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.540
Come on, get out.

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:47.610
Honestly.

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:44.790
Why am I stuck with this doll?

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.790
That is my line.

00:23:46.970 --> 00:23:49.370
This human as a medium...

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:53.020
Ah, well. Before that, prepare some tea.

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:54.640
Yes, for two.

00:23:54.850 --> 00:23:55.550
Two?

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:56.030
Yes.

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:58.300
A guest is coming.

00:23:58.300 --> 00:24:00.770
Hey, don't tell me another...

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:02.470
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:10.980
Chapter 2
Hina-Ichigo

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:06.440
Swear upon this rose ring.
